</div>
            <span class="logo-text">AxonHTA powered by AxonASP</span>
            <span style="margin-left:auto"><span class="pill pill-success">Ready</span></span>
        </div>

        <h1>Welcome</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
            High-performance Classic ASP engine &mdash; VBScript and JavaScript runtime.
        </p>

        <div class="section-title">Quick Start</div>

        <div class="cmd-card">
            <div class="cmd-label">Run a directory as HTA application</div>
            <div class="cmd-block">.\axonhta.exe --app .\file_directory\</div>
        </div>

        <div class="cmd-card">
            <div class="cmd-label">Run this launcher</div>
            <div class="cmd-block">.\axonhta.exe --app .\</div>
        </div>

        <div class="alert-info">
            <strong>How to use.</strong> Launch this HTA interface with the AxonHTA engine
            included in the AxonASP distribution. Use the command above with any directory
            containing an <code>index.hta</code> file.
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>